WHAT THE LICENSE COVERS
-----------------------

The AGPL covers the work that is actually ours:

  - the installer and the scripts under docs/ that drive PrismLauncher,
  - the pack definitions — pack.toml, index.toml, and the per-pack
    configuration and layout choices,
  - the documentation and install pages.

WHAT IT DOES NOT COVER
----------------------

**No mod code is redistributed here.** The files under each pack's mods/
directory are packwiz metafiles (*.pw.toml): a mod's name, its filename, and
a URL and checksum pointing at the copy hosted on Modrinth. They are
references, not copies. Nothing in this repository contains a mod binary, and
cloning it downloads no mod code.

When packwiz installs a pack it fetches each mod from its own distributor at
install time. Every one of those mods is the work of its own authors and is
governed by its own license — which varies mod by mod, and several of which
are more restrictive than this one. Our license grant cannot and does not
extend to them. If you redistribute a pack, or host it as a service, you are
responsible for confirming that each referenced mod's license permits what you
intend.

